  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "心內話 - 總舖師換人做"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">總舖師換人做</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 王雅玲</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgyweMuuKTdHy7DJMZgTDwxxCDHivrHuFUqMhD1gYY9uE13GWQCf_iUbcW2m6AgAwKah88m7IVkeLByeun4buexN5iPKrX_SCMlCWMdKYd4azj3hdD6HHaGGCJ4Uqdz86MZ5akd3x3_9DpInwfuF_2UooBIfCLerMx0bcbN1B2ZkXN_1OTosgIsPwIA04gL\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjZOsmSPQYs7pE4WkkiFKywtyUjdsErtXc_NliccRCgFtSCggR60mhSOdnRy5RDF6r8oZlUxm6kUIRJnHRn2XHGU0EUAeCXPzcUIuVMwRcYqfS6QnlfzOCEIiCNBvJbXK3mals8ldxL8i6Pd4vWVyVX5o2BZVLQrEL0ZafcPotSAzvJlLKzQ0lIrznghigV\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjJbFLUYSz7tceMBST3Nxtqp5Jb-FkZWuoOGNhZaW8qOi0_-mJUi30yRAm8UEBIScirT-pemGwsqkqmtdjq1GXmO2bV8DzX1Rh2Nb3RwCU8WgI36wWwQ5FBozXAoCCo6eTakTTqNHORxdUDUXZbL855MphfrJQigqkO3x8YcCtebbFySBtagdpqXOLBPHr1\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiA95qKigZVAijnR7BsIfJ2TsEU8cOq6DtSkUmQpaB9RD9sTD0b3JFS8xYYE-3FXrxtJKo7c1KiUqXV1nmllV2vNfcu5yNVA21JgQuCRUumRT6IPFeiK2FJs75BIYKgSkzA0ZpApMPyuoJVtp8EzTANkyuYtwfrEN8SIr9bBrsm8BPdptREAv30WTcJ_qg_\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        有一工，兩个囡仔補假踮厝，功課早早頂禮拜五就hōo in kha̋n-jióo--起-來。閒閒無代誌做，講beh huānn中晝頓。煮食ê冊ná掀ná看，老神在在，叫我免煩惱做我去無閒。就án-ne，我問--兩-句-仔，知影是beh liap飯丸niâ，想講tsit出菜也bē失敗kah佗位去，就放心仔去加班。<br><br>加班到一个坎站，行出房間beh便所，聽著大漢--ê leh huah：「阿母，伊講豆油兩湯匙，無m̄-tio̍h--lah --honnh？」Liap飯丸tio̍h koh ài摻豆油--ooh！? Kám是beh做豆油口味--ê？我kā應講：「Hennh--lah，你就看冊按怎寫--啊！」<br><br>行倚--去，替兩个頂真ê廚子hip寡相片，就koh tńg去房間加班。<br><br>過一下仔，囡仔huah講：「阿母，煮beh熟--ah，來食飯！」Tsit句話平常時是uì我ê喙講--出-來，今仔日總舖師換人--ah，tsiânn感心。<br><br>出來到tè，看著he飯丸ê色水無tuì-tâng，斟酌看頭拄仔hip ê相片tsiah智覺--著，囡仔講ê「兩湯匙」是用khat湯hit款大支湯匙仔來tsat--ê，我piāng--ah我，莫怪飯丸ē烏tsit形--ê。食一喙落--去，鹹tok-tok，tse若食兩粒lueh腹肚，腰子隨敗--去。<br><br>「M̄-thang硬食！」我心肝內án-ne想，m̄-koh，總--是ài kā囡仔鼓勵--一-下，我開喙講：「Tse飯丸ê豆油芳bē-bái，是講，kánn-ná有淡薄仔siunn過鹹，無，lán lām一寡白飯攪來食？」囡仔隨去電子鍋hia té飯，蓋一下掀--開，阿娘uê，tse飯哪ē煮kah tsiah大khann？<br> <br>囡仔講：「我算食譜寫ê量，koh掠暗頓、便當，算算--leh差不多ài煮五khok！」<br><br>啥mi̍h！阮兜普通時飯若兼紮便當，極ke煮「一khok」就有--ah講，tse……tse……煮kah tsiah大khann是beh食kah tī時--hannh……。<br><br>頭殼mooh leh燒，佳哉，豆油飯丸lām白飯落--去ke真好食，koh配電烘爐烘--出-來、半生半熟ê烘菜蔬，卵汁溢kah滿sì-kè，囡仔講he是tshì-sù--lah。Koh kap一杯用熟卵奶hām牛奶絞ê飲料來tsiânn做一頓。<br><br>雖bóng阿母是食著tám-tám，m̄-koh囡仔ê心意我有收--著，誠心kā in sueh謝，講in ē一改比一改進步。食飯飽，母仔囝tshuā去睏晝，我勻勻仔kā in講過去我拄做阿母ê時，mā是bē-hiáu半項，in tsiah國校仔就開始學煮食，定著ē一工一工愈來愈gâu煮。\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjNiVwx6-77-SDULgj3q_bfHrUo3_Roo6-fMTHVqrNFfDeL-o1vio8JNE9ttAr4juuoLBCoqWQ6-5qs_iB9pGdVTb4Fx16bMNui_feJU0V7T55gpISpW383Hs1sXfZ08leSSo0pL1xgP9W9oImlsdNIowsKpQE18TyjKLQL8Z02EqrK7mCeBuIDefeAxh60\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 388期，2026年07月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
